(text
"ADuM4160 BRIZ: full-speed 12Mbps; both speed pins HIGH. 24R series on all four USB lines.\nPrimary CC controller replaces external Rd resistors. OUT1 LOW only for advertised 1.5A/3A.\nTPS2553 RILIM=23.7k: max about 1.17A before resistor tolerance; no PD negotiation.\nTHM6 standard pinout only, not -B1/WI substitutions. Data isolator and converter ratings do not certify the assembled device.\nNo copper, vias, shield bond, external cable or screen supply may bridge HOST_GND and system GND."
